{"title":"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/9/399154f6df20d15781bd37b48c8645900775c8dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/b/0cbbf3f5379d42ef80b3bd0a4d67dce24ace6a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, then the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a2a699e959784ed2e68750f5930d7923507a18c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/b/7fb74a62d00cb0bc604e75ef639f45d13d27f915.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 12 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 20 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 40 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 24 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"433\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/9/399154f6df20d15781bd37b48c8645900775c8dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"53\" height=\"16\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/0/460601a9f427f7a528e2bc20fcd82e51af44f39a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 3 \\times 4 = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a2a699e959784ed2e68750f5930d7923507a18c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81dcd5ae9e4aa5db5473391516e520b9969f59d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y + 2y = 3y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/dad67f07090b95b6ca3a2df8c02b48e905e885ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/3/323803b680810a983cdf458554f8c3bcb2fa4b19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\times 12 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 36}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"139\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley\">1999 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1999 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/P